# Hailo Community Projects — Cursor Rules

This repository builds AI applications for Hailo edge accelerators.

## Quick Start
- Read `.hailo/README.md` for the master index of all shared knowledge
- Read `CLAUDE.md` for project identity and conventions

## Shared Knowledge (platform-neutral)
All skills, instructions, toolsets, knowledge bases, templates, and examples live in `.hailo/`.
See `.hailo/README.md` for the complete directory listing.

## Two-Repo Layout
- `hailo-apps-infra/` — Git submodule with the core framework (READ-ONLY)
- `community/apps/` — Where new apps go (WRITE here)
- Python imports use `from hailo_apps.python.core...` (via PYTHONPATH)

## Available Skills (hl- prefix)
| Skill | Doc | Description |
|-------|-----|-------------|
| hl-build-app | `.hailo/skills/hl-build-app.md` | Build new Hailo AI apps |
| hl-build-vlm-app | `.hailo/skills/hl-build-vlm-app.md` | VLM-specific apps |
| hl-build-standalone-app | `.hailo/skills/hl-build-standalone-app.md` | Standalone HailoRT apps |
| hl-build-agent-app | `.hailo/skills/hl-build-agent-app.md` | Agent apps with tool calling |
| hl-add-voice | `.hailo/skills/hl-add-voice.md` | Add voice to any app |
| hl-profile | `.hailo/skills/hl-profile.md` | Profile pipeline performance |
| hl-contribute | `.hailo/skills/hl-contribute.md` | Share community insights |
| hl-monitoring | `.hailo/skills/hl-monitoring.md` | Continuous monitoring pattern |
| hl-event-detection | `.hailo/skills/hl-event-detection.md` | Event detection from VLM |
| hl-camera | `.hailo/skills/hl-camera.md` | Camera setup & management |
| hl-model-management | `.hailo/skills/hl-model-management.md` | HEF model management |
| hl-plan-and-execute | `.hailo/skills/hl-plan-and-execute.md` | Orchestrated workflow |
| hl-validate | `.hailo/skills/hl-validate.md` | Validation & testing |

## Hardware
| Architecture | Value | Use case |
|---|---|---|
| Hailo-8 | `hailo8` | Full performance pipeline + standalone apps |
| Hailo-8L | `hailo8l` | Lower power, compatible model subset |
| Hailo-10H | `hailo10h` | GenAI (LLM, VLM, Whisper) + vision pipelines |
